Z||000005||Mark Matthews||12-02-2001||10:03 PM||||Ummm... 5 has all the drop shadow stuff.. and has had paths since like 2...<P>What exactly are you trying to do, I use Photoshop everyday for work, I'm a computer animator.<P>For the drop shadows, 'right click' on the layer and go to effects.<P>For paths, go up to the 'windows' roll-down and hit 'show paths'  If it says 'hide paths' you already have it open somewhere.  However, if you mean paths for text to follow, then you are correct, 6 is a first for that.<P>HTH<P>(EDIT)  I wish the program I'm looking for was that cheap!  I need to get 3D Studio Max 4.... a cool $4K!!!<BR>------------------<BR>Mark Matthews<BR>'70 BMW 2002<BR>'57 Chevy BelAir<p>[This message has been edited by Mark Matthews (edited 12-02-2001).]||||reg||1
